[10895]={"Shaking the Disease","Brifard can be found at the camp to the west, just outside of Thinglad.\
\
You should return to Brifard and inform him of your discovery.","'These wolves have become very dangerous in desperation... a disease would make them even more of a threat. Your initiative has served well. You have my thanks.'","Burn diseased wolf-corpses (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Brifard","Fallen wolves in the wolf-den are showing signs of a vicious disease spread from devouring their kin.","You have recovered a chunk of rotten wolf-flesh from one of the many wolves in the Murderous Pit. The flesh is torn by wolf-teeth, only further supporting the notion that the wolves have begun to feed on each other in desperation.\
\
All of the wolves that have feasted on the fallen appear to be developing a vicious disease. In order to cull this disease and safe-guard Stangard, you decide it would be best to burn the fallen wolves in the den.","Wolf-corpses can be found scattered about the Murderous Pit.\
\
You should burn the wolf-corpses to prevent the disease from spreading.","Burned diseased wolf-corpses (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[10896]={"'Buen trabajo, ${PLAYER}. Tarde o temprano volverán a levantar esas plataformas, pero mientras tanto nuestras incursiones contra los trasgos serán algo más efectivas sin todas esas flechas cayendo sobre nosotros.'","Wigfast se encuentra en su escondite, a las afueras de Gazatmur en la Gran Excavación.\
\
Deberías regresar con Wigfast y hacerle saber que has destruido las plataformas de arqueros de los trasgos, tal y como te pidió.","'Esos arqueros no van a dejar de disparar por sí solos. ¡Ve y derriba algunas de esas plataformas!'","Las plataformas de los trasgos están cerca del campamento de trasgos de Gazatmur, en la Gran Excavación.\
\
Wigfast te ha pedido que derribes algunas de las plataformas de arqueros de los trasgos con un simple martillo.","Cimientos inestables","Los trasgos han construido una serie de plataformas desde las cuales sus arqueros pueden lanzar lluvias de flechas sobre cualquiera que sea lo bastante audaz como para enfrentarse a ellos.","'Los trasgos de Gazatmur han colocado arqueros en esas plataformas. Cualquiera que intente atacarlos directamente será masacrado. Harán que el camino sea peligroso para quienes intenten atravesar la Gran Excavación. \
\
'Las plataformas son típicas de los trasgos, por lo que he visto: una idea ingeniosa, pero mal construida. Hay un gran pasador en la base del eje que sostiene las plataformas; si lo sueltas con uno o dos buenos golpes de tu fiel martillo, toda la estructura vendrá abajo.'","Regresa con Wigfast","Destruye las plataformas de trasgos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Plataformas de trasgos destruidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[10897]={"'Me han dicho que los Marineros tienen talento para contar historias, y que algunos incluso saben unas cuantas canciones capaces de levantar los ánimos en tiempos difíciles. Cantos de Marinos, creo que las llaman. ¿Es así?\
\
'¡Estas tormentas siempre son malas para el negocio! O no aparece ningún cliente, o los que vienen lo dejan todo hecho un desastre. ¡Nob y Bob estuvieron limpiando charcos durante horas la última vez! Y al final de la noche todos estuvimos de acuerdo en que debía poner alfombras más gruesas y felpudos junto a las puertas. Ahora que lo menciono... nunca llegué a hacerlo.'\
\
Cebadilla Mantecona hace una pausa, saca un pequeño trozo de pergamino de debajo del mostrador y anota algo rápidamente.\
\
'Aun así, creo que un buen par de Cantos Marinos ayudarían mucho a levantar los ánimos. Y además, cuando mis clientes están entretenidos, suelen comportarse un poco mejor a medida que avanza la noche.\
\
'Por eso, si estuvieras ${PLAYERNAME:dispuesto[m]|dispuesta[f]} a cantar unos cuantos Cantos Marinos en el Poney esta noche, podría pagarte un salario justo. ¿Qué dices, ?'","'Fue muy amable de tu parte quedarte hasta que la lluvia cesó, .\
\
'Lamento que el viejo Bill Helechal te haya causado problemas. ¡Te juro que tengo que echarlo de aquí todas las semanas! Para ser sincero, no sé cómo Harry logra soportarlo. Pero tus Cantos marineros encantaron al resto de mis clientes. ¡Algunos incluso me han preguntado cuándo volverás! Me dicen que a veces soy un poco olvidadizo, pero es solo porque hay tanto por hacer. ¡Aunque te aseguro que no olvidaré tus canciones en mucho tiempo!\
\
'Pareces ${PLAYERNAME:un gran Marinero, amigo mío[m]|una gran Marinera, amiga mía[f]}, y mientras yo sea el dueño, ¡siempre serás ${PLAYERNAME:bienvenido[m]|bienvenida[f]} en el Poney Pisador!'","Cebadilla Mantecona se encuentra en el Poney Pisador, en Bree.","Habla con Cebadilla Mantecona y entretiene a los clientes del Poney Pisador","Habla con Cebadilla Mantecona","'¡Muy bien! Te veré esta noche, ${PLAYER}. Solo recuerda llegar antes de que empiece la tormenta.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta es una misión en solitario y no puede completarse en Comunidad.</rgb>","Cebadilla Mantecona necesita un Marinero experimentado para mantener los ánimos altos —y a los clientes sentados— en el Poney Pisador mientras una tormenta azota Bree.","Cantos Marinos en la tormenta"},
[10898]={"Thavronwë está en lo alto del flet en Cerin Amroth.\
\
Debes regresar con Thavronwë y entregarle las materias primas que has recogido para él.","'Te doy la bienvenida de nuevo!\
\
'Ah, esto servirá, ${PLAYER}; servirá perfectamente. Mi más sincero agradecimiento.\
\
'De hecho... gira un poco el rostro hacia la luz, ahí... no te muevas.¡Puede que, después de todo, haya encontrado mi inspiración!'","Formas de la amorfia","Recoger madera de abedul (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Madera de abedul recolectada (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Piedra recolectada (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Vuelve con Thavronwë","Thavronwë, un escultor de estatuas que se encuentra actualmente en Cerin  Amroth en busca de inspiración, desearía que le ayudaras a crear una reserva de piedra y madera para él y sus compañeros escultores.","'Mis compañeros artesanos y yo necesitamos más madera y piedra para nuestros proyectos...¿Has encontrado suficiente para nuestro trabajo?'","Recoger piedra (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Thavronwë te ha pedido que recojas piedra y madera para él.\
\
Hay una gran concentración de abedules al este y al norte de Cerin Amroth, en la arboleda de Cerin Brethil. Se puede encontrar piedra hacia el este, en Gworast, a las orillas del Anduin.","'Que tu sendero esté siempre iluminado por las estrellas, amigo. Te doy la bienvenida a Cerin Amroth.¿No te resulta inspiradora la belleza de este lugar? Disculpa: soy Thavronwë, un escultor de estatuas de Caras Galadhon. Estoy aquí para escuchar a los árboles e intentar plasmar sus hermosos susurros en formas duraderas.\
\
'¿Dispones de tiempo libre? Debo acumular una reserva de madera y piedra con la que trabajar. Si deseas ayudar, podrías traerme un poco.\
\
'Dirígete hacia el este adentrándote en el bosque y luego un trecho hacia el noreste, hasta la arboleda de Cerin Brethil. Allí encontrarás madera de abedul que se puede recolectar. En cuanto a la piedra labrable, se puede hallar fácilmente en Gworast, bastante más al este de aquí, a las orillas del Anduin.'"},
[10899]={"Gathered wild essence (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'The last Elder among us spoke of a ritual that might be performed here atop this hill. It was taught to us by one of the Forest Lords and is said to open the door to the Huntsman's Hall.\
\
'He was quite old, and I was still a young man when he performed this ritual himself. I never saw him again. Nevertheless, if you wish to speak with the Forest Lords, it is perhaps the only way.\
\
'Gather the essence of the elhudan that roam this forest and bring them here. Their anger is such that they will likely attempt to destroy you, so take care. When you have done so, I shall open the door for you. But you shall go in alone... I do not wish to share my master's fate, whatever it may have been.'","'You have gathered the wild essence I require? Very well then. I shall begin the ritual.\
\
'The ritual should allow you to pass through the door into the Huntsman's Hall.\
\
'Whether you will ever emerge again, I do not know. Good luck to you, Duvodiad... I do hope that you can find some way to soothe the forest's anger.'","The wild spirits known as elhudan can be found throughout the Mournshaws.\
\
Tûm has asked you to gather the essence of the elhudan that haunt the Mournshaws.","Gather wild essences (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'The essence of the elhudan may open the way to the Huntsman's Hall.'","Tûm, the Derudh elder, believes that the essence of the wild spirits which roam the southern reaches of the Mournshaws may be they key to a ritual that will open the way to the Huntsman's Hall.","Tûm is at Gwaed Brun at the heart of the Mournshaws.\
\
You should return to Tûm with the essence you have procured.","Shards of Light","Bring the wild essence to Tûm at Gwaed Brun"},
[10900]={"'Qué extraño... los enanos usan nuestra Cirth, aunque entiendo que algunas letras representan sonidos distintos para ellos; pero estos fragmentos que me has traído son casi ininteligibles para mis ojos.\
\
'Si alguien pudiera descifrarlos, sería Mirwen. Su conocimiento de las escrituras antiguas no tiene igual.\
\
'Lleva estos textos a Rivendel y búscala allí. Es una estudiante infatigable y pasa la mayor parte de su tiempo en la Biblioteca de Elrond, en la Última morada. Empieza tu búsqueda allí.'","Compartir el poder","Winiel no pudo traducir los textos que le llevaste.","'¿Qué es lo que tienes ahí? Déjame ver...\
\
'Ah, sí, muy interesante. Pero falta algo. Puedo ayudarte, pero estos escritos no serán suficientes por sí solos.'","Lleva los fragmentos a Mirwen en Rivendel","'¿Sí? ¿En qué puedo ayudarte?'","Mirwen está en la Biblioteca de Elrond, en la Última morada de Rivendel, muy al norte de Moria.\
\
Winiel te ha pedido que lleves los fragmentos a una elfa llamada Mirwen."},
[10901]={"Encuentra a Bedwyr y enfréntate a él","Melona está en la Pradera de Juncos, esperando saber de tu encuentro con su recompensa.","Melona te dijo que el bandido Bedwyr, su última recompensa, debería estar en algún lugar al noreste, no muy lejos.","Compartiendo la recompensa","'¡Esta es tu última oportunidad, ${PLAYERNAME:forastero[m]|forastera[f]}! ¡Los cazadores de recompensas suelen tener malos finales cuando intentan perseguirme! ¡Si insistes en seguir este camino, no sobrevivirás!'","'¿Se escapó? ¡Esta recompensa se me escapa de nuevo!\
\
'Inaceptable. ¡No se escapará para siempre! ¡Lo juro!'","Bedwyr ha escapado. Deberías informar a Melona","'El objetivo es un bandido llamado Bedwyr, un aliado de los semiorcos y un rufián de mala reputación. Rastréalo al noreste, entre las rocas.'","'Eh, tú. ¿Te interesa ganar algo de dinero?\
\
'Soy una cazadora de recompensas, y estoy muy cerca de localizar a mi última presa. Pero el destino es cruel: caí mal sobre mi tobillo, y ahora no puedo moverme con la velocidad necesaria para terminar el trabajo. Si acabas con la recompensa que busco, compartiré la recompensa contigo. ¿Estamos de acuerdo?\
\
'Bien. El objetivo es un bandido llamado Bedwyr, un aliado de los semiorcos y un rufián de mala reputación. Rastréalo al noreste, entre las rocas.'","Habla con Melona en la Pradera de Juncos","Melona, una cazadora de recompensas experta, ha sido herida y necesita tu ayuda para cobrar su última recompensa."},
[10902]={"'Debo decir que nunca esperé tal muestra de generosidad. Sin duda hemos pagado por los servicios recibidos, pero la cosecha es tan abundante que no tenemos forma de transportar nuestros bienes hasta el Campamento de Adso.\
\
'Debo pedirte un pequeño favor. Justo fuera de la Casa Brandi, hacia el sur, hay un establo donde he visto a Toly Tejonera, el leñador local, hablando con la gente.\
\
'Estoy seguro de que estará dispuesto a ayudar. ¿Podrías hablar con él y ver si puede prestarnos un carro para el viaje a lo de Adso? Avísame qué te dice cuando termines.'","Compartir la carga","Toly Tejonera puede encontrarse fuera del establo, cerca de la Casa Brandi.\
\
Trumric Agripalma te pidió que consiguieras un carro de Toly Tejonera para ayudar a transportar todos los bienes que él y sus compañeros han reunido desde que llegaron a Los Gamos.","Habla con Trumric Agripalma en Nuevoburgo.","'¿Trumric Agripalma necesita un carro? Supongo que puedo prescindir de uno, junto con un par de mulas para compartir la carga hasta el campamento. Trumric es un buen tipo y seguro que me los devolverá cuando termine.\
\
'Con los problemas que estamos viendo en el Bosque Viejo, es poco probable que necesite todos mis carros en el futuro cercano.\
\
'Dile a Trumric que enviaré un conductor, dos mulas y un carro mañana al anochecer. Espero que pueda devolvérmelos en el plazo de una semana... y si estás buscando ayudar por aquí, hay mucho por hacer.'","'¿Toly nos ayudará? ¡Es una noticia maravillosa! Comenzaremos a preparar las cajas para cargarlas y deberíamos ponernos en camino a la mañana siguiente.\
\
'De verdad no podríamos haber hecho esto sin ti, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}. Por favor, toma esto... debería cubrir el costo del viaje y un poco más.\
\
'Sin embargo, me preocupa Toly; ¿qué clase de problemas podría haber en el Bosque Viejo?'","Trumric Agripalma te espera en Nuevoburgo, justo dentro de las puertas de Los Gamos.\
\
Toly Tejonera parecía preocupado por los sucesos en el Bosque Viejo, pero estuvo dispuesto a prestarle el carro a Trumric Agripalma para su viaje al campamento de Adso.","Habla con Toly Tejonera en Los Gamos.","'Todavía trato de entender cómo pudiste cargar todas estas pieles y otros objetos. Parece que los aventureros son gente muy ingeniosa. Creo que necesitaremos un carro para llevar nuestros bienes hasta Adso... y pronto: las carcasas ya están madurando.'","'¡Apúrate ahora! Prepararé a mi conductor y el carro. Trumric comenzará a preocuparse si no se le avisa pronto.'","El hobbit Trumric Agripalma está satisfecho con toda la ayuda que ha recibido en Los Gamos hasta ahora, pero los materiales que él y sus compañeros han reunido para la posada de Adso superaron las expectativas. Te ha pedido que asegures un carro para transportar las mercancías hasta el campamento de Adso.","'La sal conservará las carnes durante un tiempo, pero sin un lugar adecuado para ahumarlas, temo que solo tendremos carne curada y no carne ahumada. De verdad nos vendría bien un carro.'","'Podemos hacer gran parte de los preparativos ahora, pero llevar estos bienes hasta Adso será más difícil de lo esperado. La gente ha estado tan dispuesta a ayudarnos que tememos que muchos de los productos se estropeen antes de llegar a destino. ¿Toly no quiere ayudarnos, o aún no has tenido la oportunidad de preguntarle?'"},
[10903]={"Has derrotado al teniente de Zarquino en la Atalaya Sur.","'Hay un líder entre estos desgraciados: el teniente de Zarquino en Andrath. Lo he visto, un sujeto corpulento, un Hombre, no un mestizo. Ha instalado su guarida en las ruinas del suroeste y ladra órdenes a todos estos idiotas.\
\
'Hay que ocuparse de él. Quizá, sin un líder, los bandidos no logren reorganizarse, lo que nos daría tiempo para que más se unan a la lucha contra este Zarquino.'","El teniente de Zarquino puede encontrarse en su puesto, en lo alto y lejos hacia el suroeste, dentro de la Atalaya Sur.\
\
El Vigilante Hojafrágil quiere ver muerto al líder de las fuerzas en la Atalaya Sur.","Teniente de Zarquino","'Aunque no creo que tenga un gran efecto, derrotar al teniente de Zarquino al menos nos dará un respiro por un breve tiempo.'","El Vigilante Hojafrágil espera tu regreso al este de la entrada norte de las ruinas.\
\
Diste caza y derrotaste al teniente de Zarquino, pero los bandidos y semiorcos parecieron no verse afectados por su derrota.","'Tal como esperaba. Me temo que mi compañero, el Vigilante Robledales, tiene razón. Bree no puede resolver este problema por sí sola. Tendremos que buscar consejo en otra parte.\
\
'Has prestado tus servicios a las Tierras de Bree, ${PLAYER}. Solo puedo ofrecerte lo que te has ganado y lo que podemos permitirnos.'","Habla con el Vigilante Hojafrágil.","Derrota al teniente de Zarquino en la Atalaya Sur.","Los hombres de Zarquino y sus aliados semiorcos del sur han bloqueado el Valle de Andrath, impidiendo el comercio con las naciones del sur."},
[10904]={"Encuentra pruebas de la lealtad de los bandidos","'¿Desde cuándo los forajidos pueden permitirse cosas como medallones? ¡Ni siquiera los agentes de la ley tienen insignias! ¿Y quién es ese tal Zarquino, de todos modos?\
\
'Esto es muy inquietante. Tu hallazgo parece sugerir una organización que no habíamos visto antes en estos bandidos.'","'Mi trabajo es proteger Bree. No tengo suficientes hombres para patrullar el campo, pero últimamente he recibido informes de ataques de bandidos cerca y alrededor de la ciudad, así que me he trasladado a este lugar para vigilar más de cerca. Necesito que alguien investigue estos rumores, y tengo dinero para quien esté dispuesto a ayudar.\
\
'Siempre ha habido algunos forajidos en las colinas y valles al norte de la ciudad, pero parece que últimamente se han vuelto más numerosos y audaces. Si puedes averiguar qué está pasando, te lo agradecería. Pero ten cuidado: antes, estos forajidos huían de cualquier hombre armado, pero ahora son más propensos a atacar sin previo aviso.\
\
'La granja al otro lado de la carretera parece estar invadida por los bandidos... podrías comenzar tu investigación allí.'","Encontraste un medallón extraño","'Para ser honesto, no estoy seguro de qué decirte que busques. Si te encuentras y derrotas a algún bandido, o si puedes encontrar y registrar la granja de Maderal, tal vez puedas descubrir algo que nos diga por qué se han vuelto más hostiles.'","Los bandidos han invadido la granja de Maderal, al otro lado de la carretera y al norte, junto a un pequeño arroyo. El Señor Grimbriar te espera en la casa de piedra cerca del El Cruce a las afueras de Bree.\
\
El Jefe de vigilancia Grimbriar te ha pedido que investigues el aumento de la actividad de los bandidos. Mencionó una pequeña granja al otro lado de la carretera y unos pasos al norte que pensaba que estaba invadida.","Los hombres de Zarquino","Lleva el medallón del bandido al Jefe de vigilancia Grimbriar","El Señor Grimbriar quiere que investigues a los bandidos de los Campos de Bree, que se han vuelto más peligrosos y mejor organizados últimamente."},
[10905]={"Talk to Tautila in the Warrens","Tautila attempts to get comfortable within the cage.\
\
'I'll see you tonight, ${PLAYER}.'","Sharkey's Night","Sharkey, the vicious leader of a band of half-orcs and ruffians, has big plans for the Gladden Fields.","Talk to Tautila","'How wonderful it is to see the vales again!'\
\
Tautila breathes deeply and looks around, pausing on the ruined dredging machine next to him.\
\
'Well, perhaps this isn't the most beautiful spot, but it's certainly better than a cage!'","Tautila can be found just outside the Warrens in the Gladden Fields.\
\
You saved Tautila and defeated a half-orc, Garmog, who sought to deceive Sharkey's Men. You should talk to Tautila.","'I am thankful for what you have done, ${PLAYER}, but still I fear for the vales.\
\
'Even if I am freed from Sharkey's keeping, he will continue to pillage the Gladden Fields... and I do not think it will end there. With each passing day, more ruffians are lured into his service. Sharkey is building an army, and the vales cannot endure another war... not so soon after the last! The skin-changers are a mighty folk, but Sharkey might one day be able to overcome them.\
\
'Every morning Sharkey leaves the warrens, and deep in the night, he returns. Many of Sharkey's demons and ruffians have taken rest by so late an hour, so we might then catch him unawares!\
\
'Leave me, ${PLAYER}. Return in the night and we will put an end to Sharkey... together!'","Tautila can be found in the warrens of Tûn Melen.\
\
Tautila has asked for your aid in escaping before Sharkey returns to the warrens of Tûn Melen."},
[10906]={"Busca en la tienda del capitán de los bandidos","El plan de Zarquino","Los hombres de Zarquino se han atrincherado en el Campamento de los Bandidos. Grimbriar quiere que vayas allí y reúnas información sobre Zarquino y sus planes.","Has recogido una carta manchada","'Más malas noticias... ¿Semiorcos? ¿Cómo es posible? Esta carta lo dice claramente.\
\
'Zarquino tiene una legión de semiorcos leales a él que está enviando a Andrath. He condenado a mis hombres.'","'Gracias a ti, estamos cada vez más cerca de acabar con este Zarquino. Estamos acotando cada vez más su ubicación y el tamaño de sus fuerzas.\
\
'Ahora sabemos que el Campamento de los Bandidos, al oeste de aquí, en las estribaciones de las Tierras de Bree, es un punto de reunión para futuros asaltos. El capitán de los bandidos entrega órdenes directamente del propio Zarquino a sus tenientes.\
\
'Probablemente las guardan en algún lugar seguro: una caja fuerte o incluso sobre él mismo. Necesitamos esas órdenes. Dirígete al Campamento de los Bandidos y consigue esas órdenes.'","El Campamento de los Bandidos está en una colina al norte del campamento de Adso, y directamente al oeste del puesto de vigilancia de Grimbriar. Grimbriar está en su puesto cerca de El Cruce de Bree.\
\
Grimbriar te ha pedido que busques en la tienda del capitán de los bandidos en el Campamento de los Bandidos para encontrar cualquier correspondencia de Zarquino que pueda revelar información sobre sus planes.","'¿No has encontrado el Campamento de los Bandidos? Está casi al norte del campamento de Adso y al oeste de aquí. Cualquier correspondencia entre este Zarquino y sus hombres probablemente se encuentre allí. Busca en la tienda del capitán de los bandidos y tráeme todo lo que encuentres.","Lleva la carta al jefe de vigilancia Grimbriar"},
[10907]={"'La Liga se enorgullece de las herramientas que utilizamos. Lamento decir que algunas de las hachas que hay por aquí han visto días mejores. Si quieres echarnos una mano, creo que hay algo que puedes hacer.\
\
'Puede que haya algunas piedras de afilar por aquí cerca. Son muy buenas para afilar hachas y cuchillos. ¿Podrías buscarnos algunas y afilar bien estas hachas? La Liga te estará muy agradecida por tu esfuerzo.'","La tala de madera en el Bosque Salvaje se ha suspendido hasta que las hachas de la Liga estén debidamente afiladas.","Consigue piedras de afilar (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","En el Bosque Salvaje se pueden encontrar piedras de afilar.\
\
Debes buscar y recoger piedras de afilar para la Liga del Hacha.","Afilando hachas","Las hachas romas están en el Embarcadero de los Comerciantes.\
\
Deberías afilar las hachas con las piedras de afilar que has encontrado.","Mal Hierbanudo se encuentra en el Embarcadero de los Comerciantes.\
\
Deberías hablar con Mal Hierbanudo.","'Esos hachas parecen muy afiladas. ¡La tala de madera va a ser mucho más fácil! Gracias por ayudar a la Liga, ${CLASS}.'","Piedras de afilar conseguidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Afila hachas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Habla con Mal Hierbanudo","Hachas afiladas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[10912]={"The Free Peoples carry weapons from which the blades can be taken and used to craft crossbow bolts. The Free Peoples can be found at any of the locations they control, including the encampment south of Tol Ascarnen.\
\
In an effort to better fortify Tol Ascarnen, the War-tyrant has called to the goblins at Grothum and told his soldiers to craft bolts for the goblins to shoot into the tunnel at the mouth of the keep. Glat has left the task of obtaining the blades of the Free Peoples to you.","'Good work maggot. A few more now, and we'll be ready to call in the goblins.'","'Listen well, maggot. The War-tyrant wants to lay traps for the enemy, and so we shall. We've told the goblins in Grothum that they'll be sending us some fools capable of holding a crossbow and pulling its trigger. First, though, we need to get the goblins bolts they'll use to make the enemy dead.\
\
'The enemy carries blades and these blades can be shattered. Kill the enemy and shatter their blades. Then return those blades to me. We'll fasten together enough bolts to keep the goblins firing.\
\
'Across the bridge to the south, you will find a small encampment of the enemy. Start there. Just know that you will find the enemy at any of the locations they control and always at Ost Ringdyr in the east.'","Shatter Their Blades","'You maggot! I gave you an order. Get it done or taste my fist.'","Deliver the shattered blades to Soldier Glat","Angmar seeks to reinforce Tol Ascarnen, employing the assistance of goblin-archers, who hide behind the walls and launch deadly attacks at the Free Peoples foolish enough to enter the tunnel leading to the inner courtyard."},
[10913]={"La base de la estatua se encuentra en el patio, justo al sureste de Uxi.\
\
Uxi te dijo que examinaras la base de la estatua para que pudieras reconocer sus otras piezas.","Destrozado","'Entonces, ¿crees que ahora puedes reconocer las piezas de la estatua si te las encuentras en otro lugar?\
\
'Creo que el resto está en los campamentos de trasgos y orcos por toda Khazad-dûm. Yo empezaría dirigiéndome al este, hacia Jazârgund, esa es la dirección en la que huyeron los trasgos que destrozaron la estatua.'","'¿Ves esa estatua destrozada justo en el centro de la sala, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]} ? Según los registros y grabados que hemos encontrado, representaba a un valiente enano llamado Helgi Cazatrasgos.\
\
'Los trasgos de Moria han estado destrozando sistemáticamente todas las imágenes que pueden encontrar de él -- ¡no estoy seguro de que esto no sea el último vestigio de su legado! Estaba casi intacta cuando llegué por primera vez, pero hace poco un grupo de trasgos redujo la estatua al estado en el que la ves ahora. Se llevaron los pedazos, jactándose de que se convertirían en objetos de burla en los campamentos trasgos por toda Moria.\
\
'Si estás ${PLAYERNAME:preparado[m]|preparada[f]} para una empresa peligrosa y noble, ve a mirar de cerca la base de la estatua, para que reconozcas sus piezas cuando vayas a buscarlas.'","'Tu camino será largo, pero aún puedes cubrirte de gloria.'","'¿Eres tú quien busca reparar la estatua, verdad? Creo haber visto a algunos orcos arrastrando su torso hacia las profundidades de las Obras Hidráulicas, probablemente hacia la Cámara de las Aguas Oscuras, al sur de aquí.'","'Es una pena que una obra de arte tan grandiosa esté destrozada de esta manera. ¿Hay algo que puedas hacer para ayudar en su recuperación?'","Uxi se encuentra en la Cámara de la Encrucijada, al noroeste de la estatua.\
\
Debes regresar a Uxi para recibir más instrucciones.","'El camino que has elegido no será fácil de seguir, camarada.'","Uxi teme por una maravillosa estatua de Helgi Cazatrasgos, un enano de gran renombre en su tiempo, cuyo nombre resuena entre los trasgos como el de Azog entre los enanos.","Examina la estatua","'¿Has revisado al sur de aquí, en la Cámara de las Aguas Oscuras, para ver si hay alguna de las piezas de la estatua que falta?'","La estatua está destrozada, faltándole la mayor parte del cuerpo desde la cintura hacia arriba","Habla con Uxi en la Cámara de la Encrucijada"},
[10914]={"Destruir catapultas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Vatnar the dwarf has seen the Orcs of northern Gathbúrz moving catapults into position to attack Thangúlhad.","Talk to Vatnar in Thangúlhad","Orkish catapults can be found throughout northern Gathbúrz.\
\
Vatnar has asked you to destroy several Orkish catapults.","Shattered Engines","Vatnar is at Thangúlhad in Gathbúrz.\
\
You should return to Vatnar with tidings of your success.","'The catapults of the Enemy will be a bane upon the Golden Host if they are not dealt with, and quickly!'","'So you managed to wreck a few of the Orc's toys? Well that's done then, on to the next order of business shall we?\
\
'Time is of the essence, if we're to bring that great pile of rock down around the ears of those cloaked fiends!'","'So, we've managed to capture this tower, and it grants us a fine look at the surrounding land, but one thing I have seen that doesn't sit well with me is the Orcs moving a number of catapults nearby.\
\
'The weather here in Mirkwood is not the finest at the best of times, but in a few hours it's going to include a fair hail of falling rocks, if you catch my meaning.\
\
'Be a good sort and see if you can set a few of those on fire, would you? It is one thing being rained on day and night, but I'm not wanting a sharp crack on my head to go with it.'","Catapultas destruidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[10916]={"Mossbeard is standing at your side.\
\
Mossbeard wishes to tell you of what the trees of the Balewood have told him of Núrzum's origins.","Mossbeard is standing at your side.\
\
Mossbeard's story has concluded and you should now speak with him before you set off to return to Barallas and the other Ents.","Shattered Roots","'As I have told you, little one, there remains much to be told, but it must wait until we reunite with Barallas and the others.\
\
'Hom. They knew much of Brúndoron and the Huorn's end, but in the times between then and their awakening, they have missed many unsettling details.\
\
'We must travel to them at once, for both you and the others must know the Huorn's fate and the true wrath, unknowing or not, that has been levied upon this forest.'","Talk to Mossbeard","'I have much to tell of the coming of the White Hand and those that suffered them. Are you ready to hear my tale?'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance quest is meant to be run Solo and cannot be run in a group.</rgb>","'Not so long ago, this forest spread wide and healthy, unfettered by the assaults of Orcs and Núrzum. Those that dwelt within were mighty and took root among one another.\
\
'One of the greatest of the Huorns in all of Fangorn, Brúndoron, once dwelt where the White Hand's camp now stands. I am sure you think you know the ending of this story, little one, for there is no mistaking what you have seen at my side. However, the trees have spoken to me of darker things, and though hewn, Brúndoron's story is far from over.\
\
'Before we can return to Barallas to speak of Brúndoron's fate, you must first understand how the Huorn met its end and how the cowardice of Orcs has shaped this forest and beyond since that day.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance quest is meant to be run Solo and cannot be run in a group.</rgb>","Mossbeard wishes to share his memories of the elder Huorn, Brúndoron, and the coming of the White Hand to the Balewood.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance quest is meant to be run Solo and cannot be run in a group.</rgb>"},
[10918]={"Elúr se encuentra en su campamento al sur de Esteldín, al norte de las tierras baldías que son Dol Dínen.\
\
Debes buscar a Elúr y escuchar sus preocupaciones sobre lo que ha presenciado en Dol Dínen.","Completado","Busca a Elúr y habla con él","'${PLAYER}, tengo una tarea para ti. Los orcos en Dol Dínen, al sureste, están fortificando su posición. Cavan trincheras, talan árboles y queman tantos que cubren la zona con una densa nube de humo y ceniza.\
\
'Uno de nuestros exploradores, Elúr, ya ha partido hacia el sur para investigar. ¿Te unirías a él?'","Rompiendo la alianza","'Los Ongbúrz son enemigos temibles, ${PLAYER}. He estado observando cómo se reúnen en nuestras fronteras, al sur en una tierra llamada Dol Dínen.\
\
'Estos orcos llevan insignias que dicen mucho sobre su rango y propósito. Si pudieras recogerlas, creo que tendríamos una mejor comprensión de la tribu Ongbúrz.'","Recoge insignias Ongbúrz (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los hostigadores Ongbúrz se encuentran entre los trasgos que patrullan los alrededores de la hueste orca en Dol Dínen, al sureste de Esteldín.\
\
Elúr te habló de los hostigadores de la tribu Ongbúrz y te ha pedido que los derrotes con la esperanza de que el ejército en Dol Dínen se desanime.","Has recogido varias insignias Ongbúrz, lo que indica que la fuerza enemiga en Dol Dínen es más fuerte y organizada de lo que cualquiera en las Quebradas del Norte desearía.","Una gran hueste de orcos atravesó Ram Dúath, expulsando a los hombres de las Quebradas del Norte de sus granjas. Esteldín, hogar de los pocos Dúnedain que quedan en el norte, se salvó de ser descubierta. Desde allí, los Montaraces comienzan a planear su contraofensiva contra la marea negra de Angmar.","Insignia Ongbúrz recogida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[10920]={"The Khundolar Commander can be found at Fushaum Bal North.\
\
You should talk to the Khundolar Commander.","Defeated hunters (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'An Uruk known as Shatúrro has been hired by those across the bridge. Shatúrro brings a large group of hunters with him. You should help me take care of this, as I do not have the time. Make haste!'","Defeat Shatúrro's hunters (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The encampment of Fushaum Bal is a lawless home to evil men once under the command of Sauron.","'The hunters of Shatúrro are all gone you say? Hahaha!'","Shatúrro's hunters can be found in Fushaum Bal South.\
\
You should defeat any hunters under the command of Shatúrro.","Talk to the Khundolar Commander","Shatúrro's Hired Hands"},
[10923]={"La oveja robada de Mungo Madriguerales te mira con la mirada perdida y parece decidir que ahora es el momento de abandonar el campamento de trasgos.","Encuentra la oveja robada de Mungo","La oveja más preciada de Mungo está cautiva en el campamento de trasgos en la esquina noreste de los Campos Verdes.\
\
Mungo Madriguerales te ha pedido que luches para entrar en el campamento de trasgos y saques a su oveja robada sana y salva. Sugirió que lleves amigos, o podrías acabar siendo la próxima comida de los trasgos.","'No sé dónde los trasgos están guardando la oveja que me robaron, pero sé que estará en algún lugar dentro de ese campamento al noreste. ¡Por favor, sálvala, y te estaré en deuda!'","Robo de ovejas","'¿Quiénes se creen esos trasgos, robando ovejas a buenos y honestos hobbits?'","Mungo Madriguerales está fuera del campamento de trasgos en la esquina noreste de los Campos Verdes.\
\
Mungo está encantado de que hayas sacado a su oveja sana y salva del campamento de trasgos que la robaron y quiere hablar contigo de inmediato.","'¡Los trasgos no son bienvenidos en la Comarca! ¿Crees que alguien se lo ha dicho?'","'¡Has llegado justo a tiempo, vecino! Los trasgos de ese campamento de allí han robado mi oveja más preciada, y si no haces algo, ¡la asarán en un espetón!\
\
Tengo otras ovejas, pero ella es la mejor del rebaño y gana premios en el Festival de la Lana de Tejonera año tras año. ¡Tienes que rescatarla!\
\
Debes entrar en el campamento de trasgos y escoltarla fuera. No podrá salir sola... ¡es solo una oveja! Necesitará que la protejas en su camino, así que mantente alerta. Quizá quieras traer algunos amigos... ¡No creo que a esos trasgos les importe mucho lo que comen!'","Mungo Madriguerales ha perdido su apreciada oveja y cree que los trasgos se la han robado.","'¡Muchísimas gracias, ! Le dedicaré su próximo premio en el Festival de la Lana de Tejonera a ti, mi ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]} confiable. ¡Toma estas monedas por tu ayuda y acepta también mi agradecimiento!'"},
[10924]={"Destroy Orc targeting banners or banner carriers (${VALUE}/20)","The wall has become heavily shelled by catapults (${VALUE}/2)","Orcs are trying to plant targeting banners upon the Deeping wall to help guide the aim of their catapults. The Orcs must be dealt with and their banners torn down to avoid shells from consistently striking the wall. This will allow supplies to be delivered to the Hornburg from the siege towers.","Targeting banner destroyed (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The enemy's catapults are ready to bombard the top of the Deeping wall, but their aim is rather poor and they are missing their targets. Orcs are attempting to plant target banners upon the wall to help improve the aim of their siege commanders. Rohirrim at the Hornburg gate-house await supplies delivered from atop the catapult tower, before they are lost in the battle.\
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>Full</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Major Merit Loss:</rgb>\
* Targeting Banner on the wall causes an enemy catapult to hit\
* Supplies not delivered to Hornburg entrance\
* Repeated siege shots upon the same banner","Shells in the Air","Do not allow banners to be shelled more than once (${VALUE}/2)"},
[10927]={"Set up Molkha's tent","'Good work, ${PLAYER}! Fellgát looks like a proper camp already. Hórin made sure to pack an extra-large tent for you. That was smart of him, but the rest of us would have laughed to see your feet sticking out the end of a dwarf-tent!\
\
'The frost-bite would have been no laughing matter, of course.'","Set up Klúso's tent","Took down hobgoblin tents (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Set up Dréri's tent","Set up Náth's packed tent","Set up Dréri's packed tent","Set up your packed tent","Set up your tent","Set up Klúso's packed tent","Talk to Dréri","Take down hobgoblin tents (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Set up Molkha's packed tent","Set up Kyrstig's packed tent","Set up Hórin's tent","Set up Náth's tent","Set up Hórin's packed tent","Set up Kyrstig's tent","Dréri has asked you to help prepare Fellgát for use as a base of operations.","Dréri has asked you to take down the hobgoblin tents and clean up hobgoblin refuse in Fellgát.","'Hello again, ${PLAYER}! Has Hórin given you our battle-plan for the Welkin-lofts? Good, good. We have some work ahead of us. The cold and the lack of resources this far up the mountain-side will make things difficult for us; we need to ensure our camp is fully-stocked and shielded from the elements!\
\
'Our first order of business is to clear out the tents the hobgoblins left behind, and clean up their filth. It will not be pleasant work, true, but it needs to be done. While you are working on that, I will unpack our own tents and set them down here. Then you can prepare them for dwarf-use. We need shelter if we're going to survive up here.'","Now that the camp has been cleared, you should set up the packed tents.\
\
You should unpack and set up tents in Fellgát.","Clean up hobgoblin refuse (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Shelter From the Cold","Fellgát is now cleared of hobgoblin structures and ready for dwarf use.\
\
You should talk to Dréri.","Cleaned up hobgoblin refuse (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[10928]={"Shelter from the Storm","Beneath Dahâl Huliz, there is a small settlement in the catacombs that has been established by Rothog.\
\
He requested that you seek out Dabôr the Breaker to see how you might be of some assistance.","'Ah, ${PLAYER}! The Storm had mentioned that he might be sending an extra set of hands. To be blunt, our position is dire. Between the cultists to the north, the group of gladiators that left the camp after stealing much needed supplies, and the twisted Dead further into the tunnels, I fear we may have a good deal of work for you, if you might be willing.\
\
'Thank you for coming to assist us.'","'It is good that you have come. As your prowess and fame has spread throughout the land, I find myself in need of your services. Beneath the arena, in the catacombs, there is a small encampment known as Hulzidâr. The people that live in that encampment are considered under my protection and may require aid.\
\
'Go to Hulzidâr, speak to Dabôr the Breaker, a former gladiator, and see how you might assist these people whom I hold dear.'","Talk to Dabôr the Breaker within Hulzidâr, beneath the arena","Rothog has requested that you venture into the catacombs, and visit a small encampment beneath the Arena called Hulzidâr. He has asked you to speak to Dabôr the Breaker, a former gladiator from Dahâl Huliz, the leader of the camp, and assist them in any way that you can."},
[10930]={"Refugio en el Valle Sagrado","'Before you arrived, I had a feast prepared for the refugees from Edoras as well as my own people.\
\
'With so many taking shelter here, it is hardly a full meal for any of them, but it is all we can spare. If you would, gather the food in the mead hall and set the tables for the refugees. I prefer some amount of decorum even if my hall is destined to be slathered in filth and overrun with more people than it has ever housed.\
\
'Let them feast, ${PLAYER}. They need the hope, and I need the silence out here.'","Prepared food can be found in the rear of the Mead Hall of Underharrow.\
\
Ellen Fremedon has asked that you set the tables with prepared food in the Mead Hall so that the refugees might feast before their journey.","Collect prepared food in the Mead Hall (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Ellen Fremedon can be found outside of the Mead Hall of Underharrow.\
\
You have set the tables and prepared a fine shelter for the refugees at Underharrow.","Tables can be found throughout the Mead Hall of Underharrow.\
\
You have gathered food and should now set tables in the Mead Hall for the refugees at Underharrow.","Collected prepared food in the Mead Hall (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","As Underharrow continues to fill with refugees, Ellen Fremedon struggles to feed and house her new guests.","Talk to Ellen Fremedon","'We simply cannot house this many people, even if I am willing to care for them all. The Mead Hall will do as a shelter for now, but I shall only be relieved once everyone has gone to Dunharrow. \
\
'Imagine the mess that will be left in there... I doubt anyone plans to aid us with that.'","'Have you finished with my task?'","Set tables in the Mead Hall at Underharrow (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[10932]={"La última oveja no parece estar en Herne...","La oveja de un granjero se ha escapado de su redil","'¿No has podido encontrar la última? No hay tantos sitios en Herne para que se esconda una oveja...'","Encuentra y<rgb=#00ff00>acaricia</rgb> ovejas en Herne (4/5)","Rellena el comedero del exterior de la casa de Hulfryn con paja","Pastoreando ovejas","La quinta oveja sigue desaparecida.\
\
Deberías hablar con Hulfryn. Su casa está en la esquina sudoeste de Herne.","Encuentra y <rgb=#00ff00>acaricia</rgb> ovejas en Herne (${CURRENT}/5)","Las cinco ovejas de Hulfryn se han escapado del redil.\
\
Debes encontrarlas en Herne y acariciarlas para que se calmen.","Ovejas encontradas (${CURRENT}/5)","Habla con Hulfryn","'¿Qué estabas haciendo en las calles? No me digas que no has oído hablar del mal que acecha. Yo no soy un hombre valiente, pero algo pasa con esos jinetes. Si puedo vivir mi vida sin verles nunca más, estaré contento.\
\
'Si pretendes salir al exterior, ¿podrías buscar a mis ovejas en Herne? Las cinco se asustaron y se escaparon del redil. Acarícialas un poco y se calmarán. No quiero que salgan corriendo hacia la espesura.\
\
'Toma, antes de que vayas a buscarlas, llévate un poco de paja y rellena su comedero en el redil.'","Antes de que vayas a buscar la oveja de Hulfryn, deberías rellenar el comedero del exterior de su casa con paja."},
[10933]={"'Sigo aquí,\
tan solo queda un enemigo.'","Derrota a los tumularios en el lugar donde los dos hermanos colocaron el tesoro de Cardolan (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Rotos y destrozados\
os y metal\
la vida se derramó en la tierra.\
\
'Bajo la sombra de la piedra,\
un muro que da al sur\
donde la tierra\
dormía una vez los muertos.\
\
'En el frío suelo sagrado\
donde los muertos yacían dormidos\
se despertaron para reclamar\
nuestro tesoro.\
\
'Allí, por nuestro honor,\
durmiente y perdido,\
mi hermano me dijo adiós.\
\
'Ahora, los muertos se levantan, \
agitando la tierra\
hoy maldito desde donde\
cayó.\
\
'Nuestra maldición recordada;\
caminaremos\
hasta que los muertos\
sellan.'","Encontraste muertos cerca de un muro que da al sur, entre los túmulos funerarios de los Hombres.\
\
La sombra, a su manera críptica, te pidió ayuda para librar el lugar donde murió de los terribles tumularios.","Habla con la Sombra Errante en las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Norte","'Muchos fueron nuestros enemigos\
Por este tesoro que habíamos tomado\
Del suelo se levantaron\
A su llamado\
Su voz, su tos y su grito\
Luchamos al borde de las piedras\
En este hueco donde yacen nuestros huesos.'","Derrota a los tumularios (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Una sombra que se encontró vagando por las Quebradas de los Túmulos -- sin intención de hacer daño, al parecer -- sintió el llamado de su hermano y lucha por apaciguar la fuerza que ha regresado para despertarlos.","Hermano de escudo","El Sombra Errante se encuentra en las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Norte.\
\
Encontraste tumularios, resucitados de sus tumbas, y los derrotaste en el paso que conduce a las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Sur."},
[10934]={"'Do you think it was too soon for me to declare my regency? The children seemed distressed. Surely, they must understand that someone must lead their people until such time as Fríthbert comes of age?'","'I believe your presence will assuage the children's hurt a little. Thank you.'","Ordlac has proclaimed himself regent of the Broadacres","Talk to Thane Ordlac to attend Reeve Fríthild's funeral","Talk to Thane Ordlac","Reeve Fríthild fell ill and died during the feast celebrating her foray ay Bardh-dorám.","Thane Ordlac is in the Mead Hall of Stoke.\
\
You should speak with Thane Ordlac when you are prepared to attend Fríthild's funeral.","'${PLAYER}, my friend, a shadow of gloom has fallen over the people of Stoke, especially Fríthild's children. We must rebuild their hope.\
\
'Will you join me at Fríthild's house to honour her passing? It would mean much to the children, I am sure.'","Thane Ordlac is in the Mead Hall of Stoke.\
\
You should speak with Thane Ordlac regarding the funeral.","Shield-maiden of Rohan"},
[10935]={"Escudando al Pueblo (Diario)","La receta necesaria para completar esta misión está disponible para su compra. <rgb=#00f000>Compra la receta de la misión al líder del gremio.</rgb>\
\
Prepara una caja de escudos para Umbar Baharbêl.","El gremio de herreros de Umbar Baharbêl suministra armaduras y herramientas a la población. Tienes la tarea de ayudar a satisfacer la demanda.","'Ya sea armadura para los guardias, la gente de mar o cualquier otra persona que haga una petición al gremio de herreros, nosotros cumplimos con sus pedidos. La demanda aumentó con el ascenso de los Hermanados y sigue siendo tan alta como siempre.\
\
'Como miembro de nuestro gremio, solicitamos tu ayuda para mantener nuestra reputación tan pura como el mineral que utilizamos para fabricar nuestros productos.'","Entrega la caja de escudos al líder del Gremio de Herreros de Umbar.","Fabrica una caja de escudos para el Gremio de Herreros de Umbar","Entrega una caja de escudos al líder del Gremio de Herreros de Umbar.","Caja de escudos fabricada para el Gremio de Herreros de Umbar","'Excelente. Enviaremos estos escudos a sus dueños con gran celeridad.'"},
[10936]={"Escudando al Pueblo (Diario)","La receta necesaria para completar esta misión está disponible para su compra. <rgb=#00f000>Compra la receta de la misión al líder del gremio.</rgb>\
\
Prepara una caja de escudos para Umbar Baharbêl.","El gremio de herreros de Umbar Baharbêl suministra armaduras y herramientas a la población. Tienes la tarea de ayudar a satisfacer la demanda.","'Ya sea armadura para los guardias, la gente de mar o cualquier otra persona que haga una petición al gremio de herreros, nosotros cumplimos con sus pedidos. La demanda aumentó con el ascenso de los Hermanados y sigue siendo tan alta como siempre.\
\
'Como miembro de nuestro gremio, solicitamos tu ayuda para mantener nuestra reputación tan pura como el mineral que utilizamos para fabricar nuestros productos.'","Entrega la caja de escudos al líder del Gremio de Herreros de Umbar.","Fabrica una caja de escudos para el Gremio de Herreros de Umbar","Entrega una caja de escudos al líder del Gremio de Herreros de Umbar.","Caja de escudos fabricada para el Gremio de Herreros de Umbar","'Excelente. Enviaremos estos escudos a sus dueños con gran celeridad.'"},
[10937]={"Completa los pedidos diarios del Gremio de Herreros de Umbar (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Completa las cuotas diarias para el Gremio de Herreros de Umbar.","Los herreros abastecen a las masas de Umbar Baharbêl, y tú estás poniendo de tu parte para ayudar.","Completa las solicitudes del Gremio de Herreros de Umbar.\
\
Puedes adquirir estas misiones del líder del Gremio de Herreros de Umbar en la sala del gremio de artesanía de Umbar Baharbêl.","Completaste muchas peticiones de herrero de Umbar.","Escudos para Umbar (Semanal)","Completado","Pedidos diarios del Gremio de Herreros de Umbar completados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","¡Has completado muchas entregas de herrero de Umbar!"},
[10938]={"Lastriel has asked you to return the sergeant with the promise that she will report in soon\
\
Talk to Maldor in Ost Anglebed.","Talk to Lastriel","A young guardsman sits on the ground, coaching himself to take deep breaths. His skin is blanched and damp with sweat. Two other guards stand near him, shielding him from the views of others.\
\
A guardswoman pulls your attention away.\
\
'Hail, adventurer. Can I help you?'\
\
You tell her you were sent by the sergeant to investigate the whereabouts of the gate guards.\
\
She sighs and clicks her tongue.\
\
'Can I ask you to keep a secret?'\
\
She lowers her voice to a whisper.\
\
'Berion has had some difficulty ever since he came back from Minas Tirith. He's a good soldier and a great man, but sometimes he... I don't know what to call it. It's as if he's seeing something that only he can see. If the sergeant finds out about these episodes, I fear Berion will lose his post and that cannot happen. He needs the money.\
\
'I won't ask you to lie on our behalf, but please don't tell the sergeant about Berion. I'll report back to him myself once I think of something to say.'","You relay the message from the guardswoman.\
\
The sergeant grunts an affirmative.\
\
'Well, as long as the gate is guarded. I will await Lastriel's report.'","Maldor would like to know where his men are.","'You there, adventurer!\
\
'When you passed the front gate on the way in, were there guards at the ready? I sent two men to replace Berion and Lastriel, but they have yet to report back to me. Could you return to the gate and see to their whereabouts?'","Maldor has asked you to check on the guards stationed at the front gate.\
\
Go to the front gate of Ost Anglebed.","Talk to Maldor","Shift Change"},
[10939]={"'You saw it, right? So, what did you find?'\
\
You tell Orti that you saw the faint shimmering in Durthuzâram, but panning the waters yielded nothing of note.\
\
'A-ha! I may not have been exactly right, but I knew my eyes were not deceiving me. Perhaps it's some sort of illusion or enchantment set long ago by Durin or... dare I say, even the First Crafter!\
\
'It is fascinating, ${PLAYER}, isn't it? Who knows what other wonders we will find here in Gloomingtarn?'","'Have you been down to the tide-pools at Skelstrand, ${PLAYER}? I haven't myself, but not for lack of trying. Those blasted ukhrâsh keep chasing me off every time I get close!\
\
'You see, I swear I've seen something shimmering in those shallow tide-pools, but no one believes me! You don't doubt my eyes, though, do you?\
\
'Here, take my pan, and go see for yourself. When you return with the hidden treasures of Durthuzâram, the others will see!'","Orti can be found at Watchers' Roost in Gloomingtarn.\
\
Despite seeing the shimmers Orti described, panning the waters of Durthuzâram has not yielded anything. You should return to Orti.","Pan tide-pools at Skelstrand (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","After spying a mysterious shimmering in the tide-pools of Skelstrand on the western shore of Durthuzâram, Orti has become convinced that the dark lake conceals ancient treasures.","The dark, shallow waters of Durthuzâram shimmer beneath you...","Tide-pools can be found at Skelstrand in Gloomingtarn.\
\
Orti has asked you to pan the tide-pools of Skelstrand for the source of a mysterious shimmer he spied from Watchers' Roost. You should pan the tide-pools of Skelstrand.","Talk to Orti","Shimmers in the Shallows","The shimmering waters of Durthuzâram pass through the pan, leaving naught behind"},
[10940]={"Derrota a los bebedores de salmuera (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Encuentra y rescata a la noble","Encuentra y derrota a Rûpharo el Rencoroso","Rescata a los marineros cautivos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡Has rescatado a los prisioneros! Deshra estará tan aliviada. Volvamos a Umbar, a decir verdad, este lugar me pone la piel de gallina.'","Marinero cautivo rescatado (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Invocadores de plaga derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","¡Rûpharo el Rencoroso ruge de ira al ver a los marineros escapar!","Derrota a los espectros ahogados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Espectros ahogados derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Un noble destacado de Umbar ha desaparecido durante un viaje rutinario a Shedax Khîn en las Islas Escudo, cerca de una isla donde se rumorea que los muertos caminan libremente. Investiga y rescata a los marineros atrapados.","Noble cautiva rescatada","Bebedores de salmuera derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Barco de espectros","Derrota a Rûpharo el Rencoroso","Encuentra al explorador","Derrota a los invocadores de plaga (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[10945]={"'I see how you look at me, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'You know that I would not be so easily dissuaded from my curiosity, and you wonder how I could be so bold to demand that others abandon theirs. You see, these men are not like me... and you would do well to remember that.\
\
'They hold their position here to protect the people, not to spend their days engrossed in speculation.'","After learning the secret truths of Aragorn's siege of Pelargir, Lady Terenis wishes to silence any lingering rumours and ready the defences of Tumladen.","Scold guards spreading rumours (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'It is true that none of our foes have yet made an assault against Tumladen, but I believe it to be only a matter of time.\
\
'In the past days, I have seen the guards speaking to the people and abandoning their posts for hours at a time. And for what? To speculate about the fate of Minas Tirith and the truth of the battle of Pelargir!\
\
'Such matters are not of their concern! If only they knew the truth, they would know how important it is that it remains secret! I have a mind to scold them for their foolishness, but instead, I leave this matter to you.'","Scolded guards spreading rumours (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Lady Terenis can be found in her hall in Tumladen.\
\
You have scolded several guards and sent them back to their posts. You should now return to Lady Terenis.","Talk to Lady Terenis","Guards can be found throughout Tumladen, especially near the refugees of Minas Tirith.\
\
Her curiosity appeased, Lady Terenis has asked you to scold the guards of Tumladen that are spreading rumours about the battle at Pelargir.","Shirking a Defence"},
[10948]={"'¡Esas musarañas ladronas son lo peor! ¡Roban la comida de los inocentes hobbits! Realmente no deberían salirse con la suya con cosas así. ¡Alguien debería hacer algo al respecto!\
\
'Aunque... No soportaría que las pisotearas o algo horrible así. Son un poco lindas, a su manera, ¿no crees? Si vas para allá, solo... ahuyéntalas o algo así. Destruye sus nidos, y seguramente se irán a otro lugar.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando termine el festival actual.</rgb>","Ahuyenta a las musarañas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Musarañas ahuyentadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Habla con Nila Zarzamora","Destruye los nidos de musarañas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has ahuyentado a las musarañas y destruido sus nidos como Nila Zarzamora pidió. Debes regresar a verla justo afuera de la entrada de la cueva, al sureste del centro del pueblo de Entibo.","Nila Zarzamora quiere que te ocupes de las musarañas ladronas, pero con suavidad.","Ahuyentando a las musarañas","Nila te ha pedido que ahuyentes a las musarañas y destruyas sus nidos para animarlas a irse. Las musarañas están dentro del túnel ubicado al sureste del centro del pueblo de Entibo.","'¿Las ahuyentaste amablemente? ¿Sí? ¿Y también destruiste sus nidos? ¡Excelente! ¡Creo que habrán aprendido la lección!'","Nidos de musarañas destruidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[10950]={"Piedras de campo pequeñas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Necesito algunas piedras más antes de poder reparar mis muretes.\
\
'Deberías poder encontrar piedras de campo que sirvan cerca del gran sauce al sureste de aquí. Busca la granja de Longo Madriguera; el sauce está justo al sur de la granja de Longo. Reparar los agujeros de los muretes no será fácil, así que asegúrate de reunir piedras de diferentes tamaños.'","Belco Tejonera ha encontrado un ejemplar del Texto fundacional de la Comarca, pero se niega a devolverlo hasta que no le hayan prestado algunos servicios.","Las piedras de campo se pueden encontrar al sur de la granja de Longo Madriguera, cerca del gran sauce. Belco vive al noroeste del sauce, en las laderas altas de Alforzaburgo.\
\
Los muretes de Belco Tejonera necesitan ser reparados, y él le ha pedido que reúna piedras de campo para ayudarle a repararlos.","Piedras de campo grandes recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¿Ves a esos conejos correteando por todo mi jardín? Desde que aparecieron esos agujeros en mis muretes de piedra, no puedo mantener a raya a esos diablos. He querido reunir algunas piedras de campo nuevas para repararlos, pero aún no he encontrado el tiempo para hacerlo.\
\
'Hay un gran sauce colina abajo, al sureste, justo al sur de la granja de Longo Madriguera; allí puedes encontrar muchas piedras de diferentes tamaños. Tráeme una variedad de ellas, si puedes. ¡Nunca se sabe lo que necesitaré para reparar los muretes!\
\
'¡Date prisa o le daré el Texto a los conejos!'","Refuerza la cerca","'Estas piedras serán perfectas para mis muretes. Nunca pensé que encontraría el tiempo para reunirlas, ¡pero parece que las cosas están cambiando un poco para mí desde que encontré ese viejo Texto fundacional!'","Recoge piedras de campo planas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recoge piedras de campo pequeñas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Piedras de campo planas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lleva piedras de campo a Belco Tejonera","Recoge piedras de campo grandes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[10951]={"Los angmarim usan los escombros para esconderse cuando atacan, lo que dificulta que los Montaraces los expulsen.","'Los angmarim a menudo nos asaltan por este camino desde el este. Corren de piedra en piedra, manteniéndose protegidos de nuestras flechas hasta que están cerca. Esto hace que derrotarlos sea una tarea peligrosa.\
\
'Despejemos algunos de estos escombros del camino para que les resulte más difícil. Me los llevaré una vez que estén recogidos. Estoy seguro de que podremos darles algún uso.'","'Estoy seguro de que podremos darles un buen uso para fortificar una posición o estabilizar un edificio.'","Los escombros están justo al este de Echad Garthadir.","Escombros recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Refuerzos para las defensas","Orchalwë podría tener un uso para los escombros.","Lleva los escombros a Orchalwë","Recoge escombros (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[10957]={"¡Musarañas surgen desde todas direcciones para visitar la cesta de manzanas!","Coloca la cesta de manzanas cerca de la base de la colina al norte del huerto de Nerys Trafferth","Las musarañas se han ido... pero solo por ahora","Habla con Nerys Trafferth en Lintrev","Musarañas espantadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¿Lo hiciste? ¡Lo hiciste!\
\
'¿Crees que este fue su plan desde el principio? Eso es muy astuto por su parte, ${PLAYER}. Ahora tienen muchas manzanas y ni siquiera necesitan robarlas. Oh, supongo que no puedo estar demasiado molesta por ello. No se puede negar que mis manzanos son los mejores de todos los Valles de los Fuertes... ¡hasta las musarañas lo creen así!\
\
'Hiciste un buen trabajo hoy, y te lo agradezco. ¡Y sé que las musarañas también!'","'Mi huerto está justo al norte, ¡y está lleno de musarañas que deben ser espantadas lejos de mis manzanas!'","Plagas Astutas","'Mmm... gracias por tus esfuerzos, pero esas musarañas seguro que volverán. ¡Les encantan mis manzanas!\
\
'He tenido una idea. Quizá una ofrenda de paz muestre a las musarañas que soy una amiga, y los amigos no se cuelan en el huerto de un amigo para mordisquear su sustento.\
\
'He llenado una cesta con manzanas. Llévala hasta mi huerto, pero sigue caminando hacia el norte. Hay una colina en pendiente al norte de mi huerto, y si dejas la cesta cerca de la base de la colina, quizá atraiga a las musarañas y las mantenga satisfechas. Vale la pena intentarlo, ¿no te parece?'","'Hay muchas musarañas en mi huerto, justo al norte de aquí, ¡y temo que esas pequeñas plagas se coman todas mis manzanas! ¿Crees que podrías espantarlas? Te lo agradecería muchísimo.'","No dejan de salir musarañas en el huerto.","Nerys Trafferth está afuera de su casa en Lintrev.","Nerys te pidió que colocaras la cesta de manzanas a buena distancia cuesta abajo al norte de su huerto.","'Lleva esa cesta hasta mi huerto, pero sigue caminando hacia el norte. Hay una colina en pendiente al norte de mi huerto, y si dejas la cesta cerca de la base de la colina, quizá atraiga a las musarañas y las mantenga satisfechas. Vale la pena intentarlo, ¿no te parece?'","Nerys Trafferth está preocupada de que las desenfrenadas musarañas se coman todas las manzanas de su huerto.","Espanta a las musarañas en el huerto al norte de la casa de Nerys Trafferth (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","El huerto al norte de la casa de Nerys Trafferth está lleno de musarañas que deben ser espantadas."},
[10958]={"Frothard Tuk se encuentra en el pueblo de Campotieso.\
\
Lleva los palos de golf a Frothard Tuk.","El tesoro escondido se encuentra en el bosque al este del pueblo de Gamwich.\
\
Excava en el lugar en busca del tesoro escondido.","Desentierra el tesoro escondido","¡El mapa del tesoro del Frontero Frothard Tuk ha sido robado hace poco!","Recogidos trozos del mapa robado (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡Has encontrado todos los fragmentos del mapa! ¡Maravilloso!\
\
'Mira, este mapa señala el lugar de un tesoro que enterré por seguridad hace muchos años. Hace tantos años que he olvidado qué era el tesoro, ¡pero con el mapa restaurado podré desenterrarlo y descubrirlo!\
\
'Tenía que ser algo valioso... ¿por qué si no dibujaría un mapa? ¡Sigue el mapa y desentierra el tesoro, ${PLAYER}! ¡Tengo mucha curiosidad por saber qué se me ocurrió esconder!'","El tesoro es... ¿un juego de viejos palos de golf?","El tesoro escondido se encuentra en el bosque al este del pueblo de Gamwich.\
\
Abre el viejo cofre y saca el tesoro de su interior.","Recoge todos los trozos del mapa robado (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lleva los fragmentos del mapa a Frothard Tuk","Frothard Tuk se encuentra en el pueblo de Campotieso.\
\
Lleva los fragmentos del mapa a Frothard Tuk.","El mapa de Frothard fue robado y destrozado por musarañas.\
\
Recupera todos los fragmentos del mapa robado de mano de las musarañas en la Comarca Allende.","El tesoro escondido se encuentra en el bosque al este del pueblo de Gamwich.\
\
Busca el tesoro escondido.","Abre el viejo cofre y saca el tesoro de su interior","Encuentra el tesoro escondido","'¡Ah, por supuesto! ¡Ya me acuerdo!\
\
'¡Enterré mis palos de golf para mantenerlos a salvo mientras el Brezal del Zorro estaba siendo acondicionado y restaurado para que pudiera servir como campo de golf de nuevo!'\
\
Le preguntas por qué enterró los palos en vez de guardarlos en su cobertizo, y se ríe.\
\
¿Estás loco? No puedo dejarlos allí: ¡las musarañas siempre están colándose en ese cobertizo!'\
\
'Hobbits...' piensas para tus adentros.","Lleva los palos de golf a Frothard Tuk","'Esto es un poco embarazoso, ${PLAYER}, ¿pero podrías ayudarme con algo?\
\
Siempre he guardado mis suministros de Frontero en un pequeño cobertizo, y nunca pensé que debía preocuparme de que alguien se colase dentro... ¡pero ha ocurrido! ¡Y conozco la identidad de los culpables!'\
\
Frothard se sonroja.\
\
Son musarañas, ${PLAYER}. Han excavado por debajo del muro del cobertizo y han montado un desastre terrible. Y lo que es peor, se han llevado un mapa importante que tenía allí guardado, ¡que seguramente ya esté hecho pedazos! ¿Puedes buscar los fragmentos del mapa y traérmelos para que pueda volver a unirlos?'","Musarañas y sus mañas","¡Encuentras un viejo cofre enterrado en el suelo!","Este debe ser el lugar del tesoro escondido de Frothard"},
[10961]={"Shákrug is not pleased to see you but seems willing to talk. You notice Bregdal locked in a nearby cage","Bregdal is outside of Maudhúl Grak.\
\
You should speak with Bregdal.","Rescue Bregdal","'${RACE}, I saw you in Cair Andros, fighting those weakling Sûhalar. Your victory doesn't make you formidable -- it merely makes you sneaky and foolish.\
\
'There are many reasons that I'm here. I have my orders, both personal and from my superiors. The question remains, why are you here?! Do you help the horse men, or are you friends with those vile wood men? If you don't tell me where they are, I'll torture it out of you!'","Shákrug's stronghold is located in Maudhúl Grak.\
\
You should find and defeat Shákrug.","Ghân-buri-Ghân can be found in Drû Bhûta.\
\
You should return to Ghân-buri-Ghân with the head of Shákrug.","Shákrug's Last Stand","'Bhai-buri-Ghân is avenged. You now a part of Drúedain. A rich history with your name in it. Drúedain never forget.'","'${PLAYER}! I am quite glad to see you, here and now. Quickly let us flee from the camp and regroup in the nearby hills.'","Speak with Bregdal outside of Maudhúl Grak","'What news have you from your expedition into Taur Drúadan?'\
\
You tell Bregdal about your encounter with the Woses and how the Orcs have not made it very far into the woods due to the efforts of these secretive woodsmen.\
\
'I see. It seems as if the Woses are at least on our side while the Orcs remain our common enemy. I myself have had less luck. In searching for the Rohirrim, I was captured by a band of Warg-riders. I thought they would have killed me then and there, but that calculating Shákrug thought I was from Rohan and wanted to know where and when the Rohirrim would pass through Taur Drúadan. I told him the truth, that I did not know! Still he did not believe me.'\
\
You tell Bregdal that you need to return to the Woses soon as they are expecting your return. They may turn out to be important allies in the days to come.","Speak with Ghân-buri-Ghân","Bregdal is in Shákrug's stronghold.\
\
You should rescue Bregdal.","Examining the body of one of the Key-Warden's underlings, you find a torn patch of an Errand-rider!\
\
Now that you have the keys, you should be able to get into Shákrug's quarters. Perhaps the Orc captain will divulge information about this Errand-rider patch you found after a little persuasion.","Shákrug should not be able to escape now that you know his whereabouts.","Shákrug has been defeated!","Find and defeat Shákrug"},
[10962]={"Return to Guto at his encampment","'Ha! I relish the thought of humiliating sick half-orcs and the Dragon-clan. Let us prepare to leave soon to fight them. This will be quite the adventure.'","Spoiled White Hand food-stores (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Spoil White Hand food-stores (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Sick Enemies are Weak Enemies","Guto is at his small encampment in the southern fields of Trum Dreng.\
\
You should return to Guto with news of your success.","'We are sorely outnumbered, so we must not attack now. But I have an idea: you should spoil their food-stores, which will make them sick. Sick enemies are not very good at fighting.\
\
'You should hasten to the encampment and find a way to spoil the stores of food within. They will eat, and they will weaken, and we will drive them out of Trum Dreng. It is a perfect plan!'","Guto has asked you to spoil the food-stores at the White Hand encampment, hoping that this will serve to weaken the enemy.","Food-stores can be found within the White Hand encampment in Trum Dreng.\
\
You should break into the encampment and spoil all the food-stores you find there.","'Every encampment has some supply of food, my friend. All you need to do is find it, then find a way to spoil it. Perhaps cut it open to let the rats and mice and maggots have at it. Or get it wet.\
\
'It does not matter, at long as they eat foul food by evening.'"},
[10963]={"Derrota a las arañas en la parte oriental del Haudh Lin (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Laergil espera en el noroeste del Haudh Lin.\
\
Debes volver con Laergil y comunicarle tu éxito.","'Esta tierra ya fue profanada antes por los enanos y su fortaleza en la colina y, más recientemente, por semiorcos y crebain. Ahora han entrado en la región arañas malvadas que masacran la fauna y ponen en peligro a los viajeros.\
\
'Afortunadamente, por el momento estas criaturas malignas solo se han encontrado en las zonas más extremas del noreste del Haudh Lin, pero estas tierras estarían mejor sin ellas.\
\
'Busca a las arañas malignas y hazlas salir de sus guaridas en el Haudh Lin.'","Arañas derrotadas en la parte oriental del Haudh Lin (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Los enjambres de arañas que afligen nuestra tierra deben llegar a su fin.'","Enfermedad de la tierra","'Tu ayuda es muy apreciada, ${PLAYER}. Esta plaga de arañas podría haberse extendido por todo Ered Luin. Gracias.'","La tranquilidad y la protección de Duillond, el refugio de los Elfos, no llegan tan al norte como el Haudh Lin. Como resultado, criaturas malévolas han comenzado a infiltrarse en ese lugar de paz.","Arañas infestan el noreste del Haudh Lin, muy más allá de Duillond.\
\
Laergil te ha pedido que elimines tantas arañas como puedas."},
[10964]={"'Thank you for squashing those disgusting pests!'","'Every summer, swarms of sickle-flies plague the coast of the Lagorduin south-west of here. They're awful pests.'\
\
He bares his arm, which sports a row of awful raised welts.\
\
'Their bites and stings are so itchy! This is torture. I would appreciate if you culled some of them.'","You have done as Branach asked. Return to him.\
\
Branach can be found at his farm, Cornworth, north-west of Gnatstead.","Sickle-flies by the Lagorduin","Branach has asked you to exterminate an overgrowth of sickle-flies.","Talk to Branach","Defeat gelin sickle-flies (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Branach has asked you to defeat sickle flies.\
\
The sickle-flies in question can be found to the south-west of Branach's farm, Cornworth.","Defeated gelin sickle-flies (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[10965]={"Moscas guadaña derrotadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'La gente no se da cuenta de lo peligroso que es el tejido de cestas. El cuidado que debes tener con los juncos afilados, el peligro al recogerlos, la competencia con aquellos que intentan robar tus diseños - ciertamente no es una profesión para aquellos de persuasiones más gentiles.\
\
'¡Por favor, déjame saber cuando hayas reducido el número de moscas guadaña al este de Herne. ¡De lo contrario, pueden arruinar mi sustento!'","Moscas guadaña agresivas que aman festejarse con juncos valiosos están asolando los estanques cerca de Herne.","'¿Está hecho? ¡Qué alivio! Las cosas están muy extrañas alrededor de Herne estos días.'","Regresa con Aerona","Aerona te ha pedido que reduzcas el número de moscas guadaña que zumban alrededor de los estanques y cursos de agua al este de Herne.\
\
Herne está en el oeste de Cardolan.","'¡Gusto en conocerte! Soy Aerona, tejedora de cestas de Herne. Si buscas ganar algo de dinero, estoy buscando algo de ayuda. Al este de Herne hay varios cuerpos de agua de los cuales suelo ir a recoger juncos con los que hago mis cestas. ¡Últimamente, los juncos han sido diezmados por moscas guadaña! Bueno, por sus larvas...'\
\
Ella se estremece al decir la palabra.\
\
'¡Puaj! ¡Si reduces el número de moscas guadaña allí, te pagaré! Esta temporada puede estar cerca de terminar, pero al menos de esta forma habrá menos para reproducirse para la siguiente.'","Deberías informarle a Aerona que menos moscas guadaña molestarán a los juncos de los estanques cerca de Herne.\
\
Aerona está en Herne.","Guadañas entre los juncos","Derrota moscas guadaña devorajuncos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[10967]={"Herefara is in Brockbridge.\
\
Herefara would like to thank you for your aid in the battle.","'${PLAYER}, you have my thanks. We could not have survived the attack, nor suffered so few losses without your help. You are an accomplished ${CLASS}, and you have proved your mettle. I would have you fight by my side any day.'","'We have stood toe-to-toe with the enemy for some time and have managed to force this stalemate. They are receiving supplies and reinforcements, and it seems they are setting the stage for an assault. I fear that when the hammer comes down, we will not have the men or supplies to withstand it.\
\
'War drums can be heard in the distance. My worst fears are coming true, and they march on us in force. Please aid our defence!'","The stalemate in Brockbridge was only temporary, as the enemy is marching to assault the city, and war drums can be heard in the distance to announce their approach.","Siege Escalated","'The sound of the drums has grown louder, and the enemy cannot be far from us now. We must be ready!'","Talk to Herefara to aid the defence of Brockbridge.","Talk to Herefara"},
[10968]={"Saruman's forces have sent out their siege weapons to wreak havoc upon the battlefront. While the men on the wall focus on surviving the boulders raining down upon them, foes have crept into the deep and are planning on using black powder to destroy one of the siege-towers from below.","Aragorn has moved to guard the siege-tower's base from sappers in the deep, while the men upon the wall have braced themselves for a hail of fire from the enemy's catapults.\
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>Full</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Major Merit Loss:</rgb>\
* Powder keg is detonated at tower base","Do not allow 10 powder kegs to be detonated at the tower base (${VALUE}/10)","A powder keg has weakened the tower base (${VALUE}/10)","Defeat the waves of attackers at the tower base (${VALUE}/10)","Siege Under Fire"},
[10969]={"Siege in Disrepair","Repair siege equipment at Adambel (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Eärtur, the Prince of Belfalas, has noted that the siege equipment in Adambel has fallen into disrepair from lack of use.","Talk to Eärtur","Eärtur can be found at Adambel.\
\
You should talk to Eärtur.","Repaired siege equipment (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'It has been a long while since the Enemy attacked us directly at Adambel, and the siege equipment has fallen into disrepair. If you are able to do so, inspect the siege equipment here at the encampment and see if any of it is salvageable.'","Siege equipment in disrepair can be found at Adambel.\
\
You should repair the siege equipment.","'The siege equipment is in working order again? These are happy tidings! It is to be hoped we do not have need of them, but in the event we do we will have you to thank for this repair. What further tasks might be solved by sending you in their direction, my capable friend? Find something and do it, for the Great Alliance is always in need of assistance, as you well know.'"},
[10971]={"Dernstan is at Eaworth.\
\
Dernstan will be pleased to hear that you defeated many Uruks while defending Eaworth.","The Uruk-encampment to the south of Eaworth launches almost daily assaults upon the town.","Siege of Eaworth: Uruks of the Vale","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","Defeated the Uruks besieging Eaworth (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Uruks are besieging Eaworth.\
\
Dernstan asked you to aid in defending Eaworth from the Uruks encamped to the south.","Talk to Dernstan","'Though the southern half of Eaworth burns, we have held the remainder of the town. The Enemy desperately wants to see it turned to naught but ash. They march again upon our walls.\
\
'They must be driven back and the town must be defended once more.'","'For today, the town has been secured and the attack repulsed. Tomorrow will bring new battles, but now we rest.'","Defeat the Uruks besieging Eaworth (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Let me know when you are ready to join the battle.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This is an instanced public questing area.</rgb>"},
[10972]={"Aldbéort is at Cliving.\
\
Aldbéort will be pleased to hear Faldham has been defended and the attackers driven back.","Goblins and Wargs can be found at the farmsteads around Faldham.\
\
Aldbéort asked you to aid in the defence of Faldham.","'I do not know how many more assaults we can repulse. Every day, our numbers grow fewer. That can be tomorrow's problem... for now, it is time that we had a drink.'","Defeated goblins and Wargs near Faldham (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Siege of Faldham: Holding the Line","'A large force of goblins and Wargs has been sighted moving towards Faldham. Only the town centre has a wall; the remainder is all farmsteads spread across the plains. They will not be able to hold long without immediate aid.\
\
'Will you join the fight and protect my people?'","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","The Enemy is marching towards the small township of Faldham.","Talk to Aldbéort","Defeat goblins and Wargs near Faldham (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Faldham will not defend itself, ${PLAYER}. Are you ready?'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This is an instanced public questing area.</rgb>"},
[10973]={"The Enemy is setting the farmhouses of Faldham ablaze.","Bring water to the south-west farmhouse","'Are you prepared to endure the flames and help defend Faldham?'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This is an instanced public questing area.</rgb>","The flames at the north-east farmhouse have been slightly abated","Bring water to the north farmhouse","Siege of Faldham: Inferno","Bring water to the central farmhouse","The flames at the north farmhouse have been slightly abated","'It is not enough that they destroy our crops, steal our horses, and kill our warriors, the Enemy is now burning our houses to the ground. Without the farmsteads, we will have nowhere else to go.\
\
'Help us to defend Faldham and carry water to the fires raging through the buildings.'","The flames at the central farmhouse have been slightly abated","The flames at the east farmhouse have been slightly abated","Bring the bucket to a burning building","Bring water to the east farmhouse","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","Aldbéort is at Cliving.\
\
Aldbéort will be pleased to hear that you helped put out the fires.","The flames at the south-west farmhouse have been slightly abated","'Soon we will have to begin replacing the scorched and burnt wood, but for now, the farmsteads stand.'","Bring water to the north-east farmhouse","Burning houses can be found at farmsteads around Faldham.\
\
Aldbéort has asked you to aid in the defence of Faldham by bringing water to burning farmsteads.","Talk to Aldbéort"},
[10978]={"Artes de asedio","Has desactivado el equipo de asedio en Dol Dínen, obstaculizando la marcha de los Ongbúrz hacia la guerra. Los Montaraces de Esteldín estarán agradecidos por tus esfuerzos.","Reúne cerraduras de ballesta (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Las catapultas, los trabucos y las ballestas se pueden encontrar en las colinas y terrenos elevados, en lo profundo del campamento orco en Dol Dínen, al sureste de Esteldín.\
\
Debes desactivar o destruir las catapultas, los trabucos y las ballestas.","Has reunido cerraduras de ballesta (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Reúne piñones de catapulta (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has reunido brazos oscilantes de trabuco (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Reúne brazos oscilantes de trabuco (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has reunido piñones de catapulta (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Completado","Las catapultas, los trabucos y las ballestas se pueden encontrar en las colinas y terrenos elevados, en lo profundo del campamento orco en Dol Dínen, al sureste de Esteldín.\
\
Debes destruir el equipo de asedio en Dol Dínen."},
[10979]={"'It seems that the damage to the lower city is far more extensive than we thought. We may have to divert traffic from these areas in order to avoid further crises.\
\
'It pains me to see so many who failed to flee during the siege, but hope remains strong as long as we continue our rescue efforts. I thank you for your continued service to the people of Gondor, ${PLAYER}.'","Speak with Imrahil","Sifting for Survivors","Free trapped Gondorians (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The siege of Minas Tirith has left the lower tiers in utter ruin, trapping many Gondorians who tried to flee.","You should free any trapped Gondorians that you come across in the First Circle in Minas Tirith.","'Even though the siege weapons of Mordor have been silenced, the city continues to crumble in their wake. Many of the surviving citizens of Gondor have found themselves at the mercy of a ceaseless tide of slag and debris, and we do not have enough resources to search under every corner of the wreckage.\
\
'We have already begun our rescue efforts, but I would ask for your assistance in the rescue of any Gondorians that still remain buried.'","Freed trapped Gondorian (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Imrahil can be found outside the front gates of Minas Tirith.\
\
You should speak with Imrahil."},
[10980]={"Extracted some black powder (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Ah excellent. Yes, this powder is just what we need. I suppose you would like to know what this plan entails then?'","Thurindol has a plan, but needs black powder from the scrap scattered about the Slag-hills in order to proceed.","Thurindol can be found at a small Ranger outpost hidden in the Slag-hills.\
\
You should return to Thurindol with the black powder you gathered.","Black powder may be found within the rubble surrounding the Slag-hills.\
\
You should collect black powder for Thurindol.","Search rubble for black powder (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Bring the black powder to Thurindol","'The odds may be great against us, but it does not mean that I am ready to give up. I have a plan that will allow us to traverse the hills unnoticed.\
\
'Search the slag for any black powder. There may be some within the rubble, thrown out the gate from the scrap mounds in Udûn.'","You find nothing of use here","Sifting for a Solution"},
[10982]={"Talk to the White Company Quartermaster to trade Sigils of Imlad Ithil for Motes.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This quest can be completed weekly.</rgb>","Collected Sigils of Imlad Ithil (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The White Company has a small quantity of Motes available.","Collect 100 Sigils of Imlad Ithil to trade with the White Company Quartermaster.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This quest can be completed weekly.</rgb>","Sigils of Imlad Ithil for Motes","'If you are looking for Motes, I have just a few. I would be willing to part with them if you have some Sigils of Imlad Ithil.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This quest can be completed weekly.</rgb>","'It is a worthwhile trade! I am glad you agree. This is all I have though. Perhaps I will acquire more Motes soon!'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Completing this quest will remove 100 Sigils of Imlad Ithil.</rgb>","Deliver the Sigils of Imlad Ithil to the The White Company Quartermaster","Collect Sigils of Imlad Ithil (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[10984]={"'Proudly done, ${PLAYER}! We long ago taught the servants of the Enemy to fear the sign of the Malledhrim upon the field of battle, but I find that they need an occasional reminder of this.'","There are many positions throughout Gathbúrz that remain contested by both sides of the conflict in Southern Mirkwood.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will fail on logout, make sure to turn in before you leave the game.</rgb>","Place a Malledhrim war-banner in a contested camp","Defend the Malledhrim war-banner","You have placed the Malledhrim war-banner in a contested camp","You have defended the Malledhrim war-banner with honour","Sign of the Malledhrim","You were unable to defend the Malledhrim war-banner","'Well done, ${PLAYER}...speak with Rodelleth, and she will reward you.'","Contested camps can be found in Gathbúrz.\
\
Rodelleth has asked you to place a Malledhrim war-banner at a contested camp.","Rodelleth is at Thangúlhad in Gathbúrz.\
\
You should return to Rodelleth with news of your success.","You have abandoned the Malledhrim war-banner to the Enemy","'Show the Orcs of Dol Guldur that we do not fear them...plant our banner and defend it against all foes, ${PLAYER}!'","'I have a challenge for you, ${PLAYER}: take this banner and plant it among the rabble down below and ensure that it stands proudly as a sign of our victory in Gathbúrz!\
\
'Let us see how many of those cowards will dare to take up the challenge, shall we?'","Talk to Rodelleth at Thangúlhad","Defend the Malledhrim war-banner at the contested camp in Gathburz."},
[10986]={"This banner bears the symbol of the White Hand, the charge of the traitor Saruman. Saeradan will certainly wish to know of this.","Near the place called Gwyllion's Gate, you found a banner bearing the symbol of the White Hand.","'You found a banner bearing the sign of the White Hand. It is no secret that Saruman the White has a strong influence over the Men of Dunland, but we did not know that he troubled Enedwaith...there are few inhabitants, and they keep to themselves.\
\
'If Saruman's influence has indeed reached into Enedwaith, many of these strange happenings are easily explained.'","Talk to Saeradan at Echad Saeradan","Saeradan is at Echad Saeradan, west from Gwyllion's Gate.\
\
You should tell Saeradan of the banner you discovered.","Sign of the White Hand"},
[10987]={"Collected leather hides (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Without the hides, we cannot make the banners, and without the banners, the defenders will not come. We cannot risk over-exposing our forces here to attack. Please hurry. The defenders must come to our aid.'","Tol Ascarnen is under the control of the Free Peoples, but their forces are still scattered to the corners of the Ettenmoors.","Wolves can be found throughout the forests south and east of Tol Ascarnen. Drakes can be found to the north in Arador's End. Aurochs can be found in the pastures south and east of Tol Ascarnen.\
\
In an effort to call defenders to the central keep of Tol Ascarnen, Sergeant-at-Arms Iafileg has asked you to collect hides to weave into banners that will call the defenders to their posts at the southern bridge.","'You have done well, my friend. These will be woven into the banners we need to call our allies to the bridge. We will stand vigilant and win this day.'","Return the leather hides to Sergeant-at-Arms Iafileg at Tol Ascarnen","Collect leather hides (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Signal to the South","'We must call our forces to service, ${PLAYER}. If we fail at this task, we will suffer an onslaught too quickly, and the keep will fall. We require your aid in calling our forces to the bridge at the south, and so I ask you to assist us.\
\
'We must make flags to fly near the bridge to the south, but they must be made swiftly. We need hides from the beasts found throughout these lands. Wolves and drakes are those you should hunt, for their hides will make the strongest banners. You may also find usable hides on the aurochs.\
\
'You will find wolves in great number throughout the woods, and drakes are found to the north in Arador's End. Move quickly, friend.'"},
[10988]={"Collected leather hides (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tol Ascarnen is under the control of the Free Peoples, but their forces are still scattered to the corners of the Ettenmoors.","'We must call our forces to service, ${PLAYER}. If we fail at this task, we will suffer an onslaught too quickly, and the keep will fall. We require your aid in calling our forces to the bridge to the west, and so I ask you to assist us.\
\
'We must make banners to fly near the bridge to the west, but they must be made swiftly. We need hides from the beasts found throughout these lands. Wolves and drakes are those you should hunt, for their hides will make the strongest banners. You can also find suitable hides upon the aurochs.\
\
'You will find wolves in great number throughout the woods and drakes are found to the north in Arador's End. Move quickly, friend.'","'You have done well, my friend. These will be woven into the banners we need to call our allies to the bridge. We will stand vigilant and win this day.'","Return the leather hides to Sergeant-at-Arms Iafileg at Tol Ascarnen","Collect leather hides (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Without the hides, we cannot make the banners, and without the banners, the defenders will not come. We cannot risk over-exposing our forces here. Please hurry, the defenders must come to our aid.'","Signal to the West","Wolves can be found throughout the forests south and east of Tol Ascarnen. Drakes can be found to the north in Arador's End. Aurochs can be found in the pastures south and east of Tol Ascarnen.\
\
In an effort to call defenders to the central keep of Tol Ascarnen, Sergeant-at-Arms Iafileg has asked you to collect hides to weave into banners that will call them to their posts at the western bridge."},
[10989]={"Half-orcs can be found throughout Nan Laeglin, especially where they have raided Uch-lûth farmsteads.\
\
There must be some bosses driving the half-orc raiders into Nan Laeglin. It is possible that among them one may be carrying equipment with the sigils of Isengard upon it.","Talk to Guladus Brehures at the Brenin's Hall","Find equipment on Half-orc Bosses (0/2)","'This is it then. Now we know for certain that Isengard has set these devils upon us to force us to heel.\
\
'Neither I, nor any among my fellows who dare count themselves Men shall speak in favour of this emissary from Orthanc.\
\
'I do not know what the future holds for us, Duvodiad -- it may be that in a season's time all of Enedwaith shall be burned and barren -- but at least we shall die as stalwarts and not as cowards.'","'Find evidence of Isengard's involvement in the half-orc raids, and I shall speak out against Saruman the White.'","You have discovered a helm of the White Hand","Half-orc raiders from the mountains have attacked a number of small farmholds around Nan Laeglin. Guladus Brehures suspects that forces from Isengard may be behind the attacks, but she needs evidence before she dares speak openly of it in council.","You have found a sword of the White Hand","Find equipment on Half-orc Bosses (1/2)","Guladus Brehures is at the Brenin's Hall in Lhanuch.\
\
Having found gear bearing the sign of the White Hand upon the half-orcs raiding Nan Laeglin, you may return to Guladus Brehures with the evidence she needs to speak out against Isengard in the Council of Brehur.","'If I am to speak openly against Isengard, I need evidence that the half-orcs serve Saruman. We do not wish to kneel to Orthanc, but there is much fear of what will happen if we do not.\
\
'With true evidence of Isengard's involvement in these attacks, I and many of my people will be free to speak our anger and deny Saruman the easy submission he expects of us.\
\
'If you can find some sign of Isengard's involvement with the raiders in Nan Laeglin, that will give me all that I need.'","Half-orcs can be found throughout Nan Laeglin, especially where they have raided Uch-lûth farmsteads.\
\
There must be some leaders driving the half-orc raiders into Nan Laeglin. It is possible that among them one may be carrying equipment with the sigils of Isengard upon it.","Signs Among the Ashes"},
[10991]={"Bring the signs of hope to Borhador","The chickens are still productive, laying eggs for the village","This mountain flower blossoms, even without the sun","Collect signs of hope (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Signs of Hope","This banner holds the prosperous symbol of the Vale, a gold trout on blue field","'You are still here? I do not seek your counsel, ${RACE}.\
\
'Look upon my weary face. Do you see a leader perched over this Vale or a tired man? They call me Borhador the Old, my own people! My time to step down from Lordship was taken from me when my eldest son Dervorin answered the call of the beacons. Now I dwell in limbo waiting for my son's return or death from the monsters lurking in shadow. Does hope even exist? Now be gone from my sight!'\
\
Perhaps Borhador needs some tangible signs of hope to lift his spirits in these dark times.","Borhador has a melancholic disposition and could use a reminder of the beauty that the Vale still holds.","Borhador can be found in The Crossing-hall.\
\
You should bring the signs of hope to Borhador.","Signs of hope may be scattered around Ringló Vale near Ethring.\
\
Search for signs of hope.","'What is the meaning of this? These things are meant to cheer me up? This is foolishness. It is not a simple matter of waning prosperity in my Vale.... Hmm, but perhaps you could be useful as I admire your persistence. In some ways you remind me of my wife Halwen, rest her soul. She loved this Vale until her death.'"},
[10992]={"Entrega las tiras de tela a Andreg en el Viejo Fuerte del Camino Verde","Los Montaraces, que vigilan los movimientos de los enemigos del norte y del sur, están preocupados por la aparición de un enemigo al que han luchado durante mucho tiempo en el norte.","Signos de lucha","Tiras de tela ensangrentada recolectadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Quizá no encuentres nada, pero aún deseo que revises las pertenencias de los orcos para asegurarnos de que la gente de las Quebradas del Norte no haya sido atacada.'","Los orcos pueden encontrarse a lo largo de la frontera oriental del Camino Verde, al norte del Viejo Fuerte del Camino Verde. Andreg espera tu regreso en su puesto cerca del Viejo Fuerte del Camino Verde.\
\
Andreg te pidió que registraras a los orcos a lo largo de las fronteras orientales del Camino Verde en busca de señales de una lucha contra los Hombres de las Quebradas del Norte. Aunque los Montaraces esperan que los orcos no hayan atacado a los Hombres de las Quebradas del Norte, desean investigar y asegurarse de que no sea el caso.","'Aunque no me agrada pedirlo, y espero que no encuentres nada en tus investigaciones, debo pedirte que completes una tarea macabra mientras purgas a los orcos de las Tierras de Bree.\
\
'Los orcos han venido desde las Quebradas del Norte, y el sendero más sencillo para ellos habrá sido a través del acosado pueblo de Puente de Caballetes. Te pediría que registres a los orcos que derrotes en busca de señales de una lucha contra la gente de las Quebradas del Norte en forma de tela hecha por Hombres.\
\
'Si encuentras algo de ese tipo, devuélvelo a mí aquí en mi puesto.'","Recolecta tiras de tela ensangrentada (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Este hallazgo me deja más preocupado que antes. Aun así, nuestro enfoque debe permanecer aquí en las Tierras de Bree. Hay vidas que salvar aquí, así como en el Norte, y debemos establecer al menos un baluarte contra los orcos.\
\
'Gracias por hacer esto, ${PLAYER}.'"},
[10993]={"You have been asked to go back into the woods of Thinglad to investigate more signs of trouble, now that the Rohirrim have departed.","Find Renfaer in Thinglad","'Greetings to you, ${PLAYER}. Now that the Rohirrim are gone, it would seem that we have enemies at our doorstep, and not just mere trespassers.\
\
'I have spotted signs of Orcs and Wargs, newly moved into this part of the woods.'","'Noriel has gone off into the woods once again to investigate more signs of trouble, and she would like you to do the same by helping our scout, Renfaer, to the south. He saw animals and birds fleeing, and we want to know why.\
\
'What do you say, ${PLAYER}? You seem a helpful sort of ${RACE}, and a stout fighter from what I have heard. He went south-east only a little while ago.'","Thinglad's scout can be found south-east from Haldirith.\
\
Limfind has asked you to find and help the scout Renfaer.","'Renfaer headed south-east to follow signs that animals were fleeing that part of the woods.'","Signs of Trouble"},
[10994]={"'Ah, tragic, just when I was getting comfortable...\
\
'I did not trust my fellows to get the job done, and rightfully so it seems.\
\
'This homestead belongs to the Dunlendings now, so either throw your lot in with us, or you won't be leaving this house.'","Look at the fields for sign of the Enemy","'What? Impossible!\
\
'He has been a trusted friend to my family for years... why would he attack you? I assure you this was not my doing, ${PLAYER}... you must believe me!\
\
'All that matters to me is that my family is safe. What has become of Rohan?'","'Are you who I am to meet?'","'What word of the homestead?'","Folcbur can be found at the traders' pavillion in central Middlemead.\
\
You have defeated the traitorous warrior Folcbur sent you to meet, and should now reveal what you have learned of the homestead.","Search the farmhouse","'Greetings, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Hildulf told me you would be able to help me with my troubles, so thank you for your aid. You see, my family lives at a small homestead south-east of Middlemead, and none of our crops have been coming into the village for a day or two. We have had lapses before, but this one has me worried.\
\
'I sent my friend, Torwulf, to check on my family earlier today. If you would, meet him at the homestead and see if you two can figure out what is happening.'","The farmhouse is at the centre of the homestead to the south-east of Middlemead.\
\
You have found no sign of the Enemy and should rejoin Torwulf inside the farmhouse.","Talk to Folcbur","Talk to Torwulf at the homestead south-east of Middlemead","This is a good place to look","You see nothing amidst the swaying crops below","The windmill can be found at the southern end of Folcbur's homestead south-east of Middlemead.\
\
You have met with Torwulf and are now to scout the homestead for sign of the Enemy. You should look from atop the windmill.","Find Torwulf","Torwulf is somwhere inside the farmhouse at the homestead south-east of Middlemead.\
\
You have heard noises from within the farmhouse. You should try to find Torwulf.","Silence at the Homestead","Folcbur has heard little from her homestead to the south-east of Middlemead, and fears that something is afoot at the farm.","Scout the windmill at the homestead","Torwulf can be found outside the farmhouse at the homestead south-east of Middlemead.\
\
Concerned by a lack of shipments, Folcbur has sent you to investigate the farm south-east of town and meet with a town guard also stationed there.","'That took you long enough.'","'Ah, just in time! All has been quiet so far, and I have seen no sign of the crofters. Strange, indeed...\
\
'Folcbur told me of her concerns and they seem quite warranted, so let us search the farm. I shall scout the farmhouse, and you should begin by searching the windmill - perhaps you can get a good look at the surrounding fields from the balcony.'","Defeated Torwulf","As you approach the door, you hear voices inside"},
[10995]={"Derrota a los huargos en Athmadhul (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Los orcos que vienen de Khazad-dûm han encontrado un poderoso aliado en los huargos aquí en el valle. Esto es algo muy malo para nosotros, ya que no podemos igualar a los jinetes de huargos en combate. Son demasiado rápidos y fuertes.\
\
'Si queremos luchar contra esta nueva amenaza, primero tendremos que atacar a los huargos. Dirígete al sureste, a Athmadhul, y reduce el número de huargos allí. Una vez que hayamos hecho eso, podemos comenzar a pensar en los jinetes.\
\
'Ten cuidado, ${PLAYER}, porque las bestias son peligrosas, incluso solas. Regresa a verme cuando hayas terminado.'","Los jinetes de huargos del Valle del Arroyo Sombrío han estado acosando el campamento enano de Mekhem-bizru desde que se estableció.","Ótam se encuentra en Mekhem-bizru, al noroeste de Athmadhul.\
\
Ótam estará encantado de saber que los huargos alrededor de Athmadhul han sido reducidos.","Silencio de los huargos","'Los huargos han sido silenciados, pero aún queda mucho por hacer. Los orcos siguen ahí, y son un enemigo peligroso.'","Habla con Ótam en Mekhem-bizru","'Si no hay huargos para montar, no habrá jinetes de huargos para saquear.'","Huargos derrotados en Athmadhul (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los huargos se encuentran en Athmadhul, al sureste de Mekhem-bizru.\
\
Ótam quiere que reduzcas el número de huargos para que haya menos jinetes de huargos que molesten a los enanos."},
[10997]={"There are two small encampments that the Draig-lûth established. These men are dangerous and prey upon the Uch-lûth.","Silence the Sentries","'The Draig-lûth do not belong in this land...it belongs to the Uch-lûth.'","Gronu's camp lies almost due north of Harndirion.\
\
You should return to Gronu and let him know that you have defeated many of the sentries near Pruv Cadlus and Sarf Cadlus.","Defeated sentries near Sarf Cadlus (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Gronu at his camp","'The defeat of the sentries marks the beginning of the end for these foul duhirun. I appreciate your assistance, for it shows that there are duvodiad who will fight for my people.'","The Draig-lûth camps are east and north-east of Harndirion.\
\
Gronu has asked you to seek out Pruv Cadlus and Sarf Cadlus on the eastern slope below Harndirion and defeat sentries at each of the camps.","Discovered Sarf Cadlus","Defeat sentries near Sarf Cadlus (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat sentries near Pruv Cadlus (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Discovered Pruv Cadlus","'It is well, I suppose, that you have found me. The Draig-lûth who came from the South are a vile and cruel people. It is said that they take captive those that would enter this land and offer them to the gwiber and giants that dwell within.\
\
'On the other side of this hill, there are two small encampments: Pruv Cadlus and Sarf Cadlus. These encampments are used as forward outposts for the Draig-lûth in this area. If you could go to these camps and dispatch their sentries, I would be very appreciative.\
\
'The camps can be found to the east and north-east of Harndirion. Please be careful, Duvodiad, for it is said that those ruins are cursed place and that foul spirits call it home.'","Defeated sentries near Pruv Cadlus (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Discover Pruv Cadlus","Discover Sarf Cadlus"},
[10998]={"There are two small encampments that the Draig-lûth established. These men are dangerous and prey upon the Uch-lûth.","'The Draig-lûth do not belong in this land...it belongs to the Uch-lûth.'","Gronu's camp lies almost due north of Harndirion.\
\
You should return to Gronu and let him know that you have defeated many of the sentries near Pruv Cadlus and Sarf Cadlus.","Defeated sentries near Sarf Cadlus (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Gronu at his camp","'The defeat of the sentries marks the beginning of the end for these foul duhirun. I appreciate your assistance, for it shows that there are duvodiad who will fight for my people.'","'Duvodiad, your aid is welcome. Continue, if you would, to harry the sentries of the Draig-lûth at Pruv Cadlus and Sarf Cadlus. If you do this, my people will keep you in esteem.'","The Draig-lûth camps are east and north-east of Harndirion.\
\
Gronu has asked you to seek out Pruv Cadlus and Sarf Cadlus on the eastern slope below Harndirion and defeat sentries at each of the camps.","Discovered Sarf Cadlus","Silence the Sentries -- Repeatable","Defeat sentries near Sarf Cadlus (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat sentries near Pruv Cadlus (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Discovered Pruv Cadlus","Defeated sentries near Pruv Cadlus (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Discover Pruv Cadlus","Discover Sarf Cadlus"},
[10999]={"Defeat Orcs in southern outpost (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Reached the western Orc outpost","Defeat the Orcs at the western outpost to help Galâmka in their preparations for the battle in Maurûsh.","Defeated Orcs in southern outpost (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat the Orcs at the southern outpost to help Galâmka in their preparations for the battle in Maurûsh.","Find the Orc outpost to the east of Maurûsh that was discovered by the scouts.","Return to Galâmka in Ub Nishir","Defeat the Orcs at the eastern outpost to help Galâmka in their preparations for the battle in Maurûsh.","Find the Orc outpost to the south of Maurûsh that was discovered by the scouts.","'Good, you have arrived. The battle draws near but there is one more task I ask of you.\
\
'My scouts have returned from the spots detailed in the scraps you recovered from the Orcs. They mark the locations of Orc outposts and from what my scouts can gather they are for scouting and calling for help if Maurûsh should come under heavy attack. We must take them out before we can attempt to take the stronghold.'\
\
Galâmka gestures to three locations on his map surrounding Maurûsh.\
\
'These spots to the west, south, and east are where the outposts stand. Go there are slay the Orcs so they can not call for aid during our attack.'","Find the western Orc outpost","'Have you dealt with the outposts?'\
\
You tell Galâmka that you have successfully defeated the Orcs in the outposts the scouts had found.\
\
'Wonderous news! Again, I can not thank you enough for all that you have done. Our preparations here are coming to an end and hope grows in the people. I ask that you join us in battle. We are ready to retake our home.\
\
'We are ready to fight for Maurûsh.'","Defeat Orcs in eastern outpost (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Reached the southern Orc outpost","Silencing the Outposts","Galâmka has asked you to clear out the outposts the Orcs have set up outside of Maurûsh to prevent them from calling for help when the attack begins.","Find the southern Orc outpost","Reached the eastern Orc outpost","Defeated Orcs in western outpost (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Return to Galâmka in Ub Nishir to the north of Maurûsh and inform him that the outposts have been cleared out.","Defeat Orcs in western outpost (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Find the Orc outpost to the west of Maurûsh that was discovered by the scouts.","Find the eastern Orc outpost","Defeated Orcs in eastern outpost (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
}
